description	"Jace Malcom

Durable Leader with High Explosive Potential.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibroknife (Purple Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 5
- Havoc Assault Cannon
-- Minigun (2)
-- Knocks Back/Stuns/Cripples, 200% more damage/150% More FP Drain
-- 10% less velocity, 700% slower RoF 
-- Mag Reload
- Republic Commander Pistol
-- Blaster Pistol (2)
-- Mag Reload 
- Thermal Detonator (1)
- Frag Grenades (2)

^8Attributes:
- 10% more knockback given
- 40% less knockback taken
- Armor Regen: 2/s to 25
- Resource Regen: 4/2s
- Healing (1)
- Strength (2)
- Blast Armor
- Rally
- Beskar (2)
- Anti MT (1)
- 200% Slower Cooldowns
- Fury (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Cortosis (1)

^3Abilities:
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS1]
- Soldiers Fury ^3[CS2]
- Sacrifice (Self Explode 3) ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (1) ^3[CS4]"